  "text": "Meseret Kinfe Haile is an Ethiopian poet and author best known for her poetry collection titled Ye Tikur Enat Negn (የጥቁር እናት ነኝ \"I am the Mother of Black\"). Her work focuses heavily on themes of motherhood, personal endurance, identity, and social awareness. Literary Work and Philanthropy Ye Tikur Enat Negn: This poetry collection was"
